OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny intervals and a
OL,6,Ffew showers these more frequent over
OL,7,Fthe Trossachs and western Perthshire.
OL,8,FBest of the sunshine over Angus and
OL,9,Fthe east coast. Less windy and a
OL,10,Flittle milder too.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and
OL,13,Fnight with some clear periods. More
OL,14,Fcloud in the west at times. Winds
OL,15,Fmainly light.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA mostly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith some sunny spells, best along the
OL,19,Feast coast. More cloud likely across
OL,20,FStirlingshire with some light showers.
OL,21,Fin Upper Deeside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
